        "titleStart": "The Impact of Fresh Ingredients on",
        "titleHighlight": "Great Food",
        "intro": "Fresh ingredients are the heart of every great dish. They bring natural flavours, vibrant colours and essential nutrients, making food not only delicious but also healthier. In this article, we explore why fresh ingredients matter and how they can transform your dining experience.",
        "firstSectionTitle": "Why Fresh Ingredients Matter",
        "firstSectionText": "Using fresh, seasonal ingredients enhances the taste, texture and aroma of every dish. Fresh produce contains more nutrients, fewer preservatives and a natural flavour that processed ingredients simply can’t match.",
